hanetsky","email":"ilia@ilia.ws","date":"2026-06-21T16:29:31Z"},"message":"ext/gd: fix out-of-bounds write reading font header on short reads\n\nimageloadfont() read the font header with `(char*)&font[b]`, which scales\nthe byte counter b by sizeof(gdFont) rather than advancing one byte, so a\nshort php_stream_read() (deliverable by a user stream wrapper) makes the\nloop write hdr_size-b bytes past the emalloc(sizeof(gdFont)) buffer. Index\nthe destination by bytes, matching the body read a few lines below.\n\nCloses GH-22380","tree":{"sha":"cfede5556fc723327d0cf2d34c698918a49f2dd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/git/trees/cfede5556fc723327d0cf2d34c698918a49f2dd9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/git/commits/df1250dc64f53db849503618d2f911645cd43e3a","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgdYhKZ4kd7+tlpRbDZ0aP7UxDG4\ndIRutl3Ksx2/yts4sAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQFukOnQ5zxeMTCIWeb0jAEAq6k1GnZQ/hTrFuWOG42cjHVPCW3doPa2ttjEdrf3oZP\ngAJHRwuGoyt4g0oCPeRQE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree cfede5556fc723327d0cf2d34c698918a49f2dd9\nparent 19f595fd9ea9974e649c43819ffb08a47fc3fd77\nauthor Ilia Alshanetsky <ilia@ilia.ws> 1782003006 -0400\ncommitter Ilia Alshanetsky <ilia@ilia.ws> 1782059371 -0400\n\next/gd: fix out-of-bounds write reading font header on short reads\n\nimageloadfont() read the font header with `(char*)&font[b]`, which scales\nthe byte counter b by sizeof(gdFont) rather than advancing one byte, so a\nshort php_stream_read() (deliverable by a user stream wrapper) makes the\nloop write hdr_size-b bytes past the emalloc(sizeof(gdFont)) buffer. Index\nthe destination by bytes, matching the body read a few lines below.\n\nCloses GH-22380\n","verified_at":"2026-06-21T16:38:55Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/commits/df1250dc64f53db849503618d2f911645cd43e3a","htm